<title>UK: Bangladesh issues two tenders to buy white sugar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh issues two tenders to buy white sugar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh has tendered on March 8 and 15 to buy one cargo of 150 ICUMSA white sugar on each day, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Required shipment dates have yet to be clarified but one trader said March 11/April 11 could be the period for the first tender, with shipment before April 25 for the second.</p>
<p>Bangladesh bought 12,500 tonnes of 150 ICUMSA white sugar at $347.95 per tonne c &amp; f basis at its tender on March 1, again for March 11/April 11.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
